<title>NETHERLANDS: VASTNED RETAIL 1996 NET PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>VASTNED RETAIL 1996 NET PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>Direct investment income (net profit)  62.5  vs  58.9</p>
<p>    ditto per share (guilders)		  8.08 vs   7.89</p>
<p>NOTE - Property investment fund VastNed Retail NV previously</p>
<p>said it expected direct investment income per share to show a</p>
<p>rise in 1996.</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)			   8.05 vs   7.85</p>
<p>    Rental income				 110.0  vs 106.1</p>
<p>    Interest charges			     24.1  vs  25.2</p>
<p>    Positive property revaluation	     0.7  vs  14.4 charge</p>
<p>NOTE - VastNed Retail NV said its 1996 dividend could be</p>
<p>taken up in cash or in new shares. Details of the optional stock</p>
<p>dividend will be published at a later date.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
